1
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,200
大都會的頭家叫做王電火 | Tāi-too-huē ê thâu-ke kiò-tsò Ông Tiān-hué | The boss of the metropolis is named King of Light

2
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,298
督著伊我就一箍懶攏免買 | Tu-tio̍h i guá tiō tsi̍t-khoo-lān lóng bián bé | When I ran into him, I did not have to buy a damn thing

3
00:00:45,298 --> 00:00:48,500
伊大的小的束的膨的攏總有賣 | I tuā--ê sè--ê sok--ê phòng--ê lóng-tsóng ū bē | He sells big ones, small ones, slim ones, and bulky ones

4
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,000
恁爸的簏袋夠我買一罐 麥仔茶 | Lín-pē ê lak-tē kàu guá bé tsi̍t kuàn beh-á-tê | My pocket has just enough money to buy a can of barley tea

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,200
天頂的蟑螂四界飛 | Thinn-tíng ê ka-tsu̍ah-á sì-kè pue | Cockroaches in the sky are flying everywhere

6
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,700
趖佇土腳的蟲嘛真濟 | Sô tī thôo-kha ê thâng mā tsin tsē | Bugs crawling on the ground are plenty too

7
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
啊頭家啊頭家你就算我較俗咧 | Ah thâu-ke ah thâu-ke lí tiō sǹg guá khah sio̍k--leh | Oh boss, oh boss, please give me a cheaper discount

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,500
你講少年欸你無才調就莫刣價 | Lí kóng siàu-liân--ê lí bô tsâi-tiāu tiō mài thâi-kè | You say young man, if you have no skills then do not haggle

9
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
啊娘偎我哪會遮爾衰 | Ah-niâ-uī guá ná ē tsiah-nī sue | Oh my goodness, how did I get this unlucky

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,900
買一葩電火予人洗甲虛累累 | Bé tsi̍t phā tiān-hué hōo lâng sé kah hi-luī-luī | Bought a light bulb and got scolded until I felt drained

11
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,099
出外無工課佇內底毋知㧙啥貨 | Tshut-guā bô khang-khuè tī lāi-té m̄-tsai piak siánn-huè | No work outside, do not know what tricks I am pulling inside

12
00:01:11,099 --> 00:01:14,799
你罵我攏袂歹勢 我係過了真鬆勢 | Lí mē guá lóng bē pháinn-sè, guá sī kuè kah tsin sang-sè | You scold without shame, but I live carefree and relaxed

13
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:17,599
王電火你尚好莫傷超過 | Ông Tiān-hué lí siōng-hó mài siunn tshiau-kuè | King of Light, you better not cross the line

14
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:20,099
看咧好勢好勢 其實咧欺騙社會 | Khuànn--leh hó-sè hó-sè, kî-si̍t teh khi-phiàn siā-huē | Looking proper on the outside, but actually scamming society

15
00:01:20,099 --> 00:01:23,099
當做食老兩三歲 當做少年攏盲 | Tòng-tsò tsia̍h-lāu nn̄g-sann huè, tòng-tsò siàu-liân lóng tshinn-mê | Just because you are older, you think all youth are blind

16
00:01:23,099 --> 00:01:36,000
